DESCRIPTION:"We will screen a film created by Aidin Robbins\, an Asheville 
 local\, which focuses heavily on the impact on Pisgah and Nantahala Forest
 s. After the film ends\, there will be opportunities to ask questions to l
 ocal Roadless experts to learn more about what the rescission of the Rule 
 will mean for Western North Carolina. There will also be opportunities to 
 craft a comment of your own to submit to the USFS. "\n\n \n\nOpportunities
  for oral and written comments will be provided as well as t-shirt give aw
 ay\, free tie dye station\, food and drinks!\n\n \n\nhttps://mountaintrue.
 org/event/rally-for-the-roadless-rule-in-asheville-nc/\n\n \n\nFor more in
 formation\, please contact Donovan Green at:\n\n828-617-0813\n\ndonovan@mo
 untaintrue.org
GEO:35.613818;-82.438862
LOCATION:Kittredge Arts Center\, Kittredge Theater
SUMMARY:Film Screening and Q&A for the Roadless Rule
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/film-screening-and-qa-
 for-the-roadless-rule
CATEGORIES:Social
END:VEVENT
