DTEND:20260917T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us at 7:30pm on Wednesday\, September 16\, in the Williams
  Recital Hall\, for a night of East and West African music\, featuring the
  djembe\, the kora\, and more\, played by two brilliant musical minds.
LOCATION:Williams Recital Hall
