DESCRIPTION:Get ready for Midterms and register to vote by visiting the WNC
 Votes! Table in GLAD on Fridays\, 11:30 a.m.- 1 p.m.!\n\n \n\nThe deadline
  to register to vote on Election Day is Oct. 9! If you are an NC-DMV custo
 mer\, you can register or update your registration online at youcanvote.or
 g/register. Learn more about how to make your voice heard and be #VoteRead
 y!\n\n#Vote2026 #YouCanVoteNC# #OwlsVote! \n\n \n\nYou can register to vot
 e during early voting\, starting Oct 15-31st and vote the same day\, BUT i
 f you plan to vote on Tuesday\, Nov. 3rd\, you must register by Oct. 9th!
LOCATION:Gladfelter
