DESCRIPTION:Adventure Programs will be hosting an outdoor climbing trip to 
 The Dump September 27th (Sunday) \nLocated in Blowing Rock\, NC! This area
  offers some of the best concentration of sport routes in NC high country.
 \n\nIf you've been interested in climbing and haven't had the chance to tr
 y it out\, come along! If you love to mountaineer\, explore nature\, nurtu
 re your body\, and spirit with natural movement\, and climb cool rocks\, c
 ome vibe with us! \n\nNo chalk? No climbing shoes? No harness? No worries!
 \n\nAll gear will be provided! If you have gear of your own\, please feel 
 free to bring anything that would feel comfortable for you :)\n\nBring lot
 s of water\, as well as a jacket for in the morning since it will be a lit
 tle bit cooler. We will meet at Bryson gym at 8am\, grab some breakfast @g
 lad and then head out shortly after that.  \nWe'll all leave with time to 
 get back to campus and have dinner!
GEO:35.612776;-82.440872
LOCATION:Bryson Gym
