DESCRIPTION:oin students and faculty to learn about Inside-Out\, the Colleg
 e’s higher education in prison program in partnership with Western Corre
 ctional Center for Women. Inside-Out is the only program in North Carolina
  that brings together college students (“Outside”) with incarcerated s
 tudents (“Inside”) for credit‑bearing courses taught inside the pris
 on.\n\nAt this information session\, you’ll hear about the courses being
  offered in Spring Semester 2027\, learn how the program works\, and liste
 n to first‑hand experiences from students who have participated in Insid
 e-Out classrooms. You’ll also have a chance to ask questions and explore
  how Inside-Out connects to social justice learning\, community engagement
 \, and equity through higher education in prison.
