DESCRIPTION:It's late October. Samhain & Halloween are near\, and it's time
  to let ourselves get a little wild.\n \n\nCome dance\, sweat\, laugh\, an
 d enjoy the magic of this time of year. Costumes are welcome\, but not req
 uired. Come as something\, someone\, anything\, or simply as yourself.\n \
 n\nThis evening falls on my birthday. I'd love to celebrate by gathering a
  mix of students and community members to dance. (When I was a kid\, my bi
 rthday parties always had a habit of becoming Halloween parties anyway.)\n
 \nScheduled for the pavilion. If the weather is too cold\, we'll be in Bry
 son Gym.
