 ds\, javelins and arrows.\n\n \n\nLoaner weapons are provided for everyone
  for free\, and anyone is welcome to come fight and learn!\n\nWe play game
 s like capture the flag\, or do drills to train fighting skillz.\n\n \n\nb
 ring ya friends\, bring water\, have fun.
